Printable photo reconstruction worker

This image includes MediaPipe's face landmarker model, face_landmarker.task,
downloaded unmodified from
https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/face_landmarker/face_landmarker/float16/1/face_landmarker.task
It is published by Google under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The license
text and MediaPipe's NOTICE are installed with the mediapipe Python package in
this image, under
/opt/recon/lib/python3*/site-packages/mediapipe-*.dist-info/licenses/.

OpenCV is built from the opencv-python 5.0.0.93 source distribution with only
its core and image processing modules, without FFmpeg or other media
libraries. It is under the Apache License, Version 2.0; its license is at
/opt/opencv-python/LICENSE-OpenCV.

The installed Python packages, including PyTorch and torchvision, carry their
own licenses in their .dist-info directories under
/opt/recon/lib/python3*/site-packages/.

The image contains no MICA, SMIRK, DECA or FLAME model files. Those are
obtained separately by the operator and mounted at run time.
